                  en: "Today we learn about circles! ⭕\n\nWhat does a circle look like? It has no corners, it's round and smooth.\n\nCircles in daily life: The moon 🌕, a pizza 🍕, a football ⚽, a car wheel 🚗, a clock 🕐\n\nWhy are wheels circular? Because circles can roll! If wheels were square, the car would bump along. Circular wheels make the car go fast and smooth.\n\nLet's draw a circle! Use your finger to draw a big circle in the air, like drawing the sun! ☀️",
