                  en: "Everyone has a special name! What is your name?\n\nWhen you meet new friends, you can say: 'Hello, my name is ___!'\n\nNames are like our labels, letting others know who we are. Each name is carefully chosen by parents and has a special meaning.\n\nFor example: Emily — means 'hardworking', Oliver — means 'peace', Sophie — means 'wisdom'\n\nLet's practice introducing ourselves! Stand in front of everyone and say loudly: 'Hello everyone, my name is ___! I am ___ years old!' 👏",
