                  en: "We use five senses to explore the world! 🌟\n\n👀 Sight (Eyes) — seeing colors, shapes, sizes\n👂 Hearing (Ears) — hearing music, voices, birds\n👃 Smell (Nose) — smelling flowers, food\n👅 Taste (Tongue) — tasting sweet, sour, bitter, salty\n✋ Touch (Skin) — feeling hot, cold, soft, hard, rough, smooth\n\nSense Game: Close your eyes — can you guess what you're holding? Touch it — is it soft or hard? Smell it — what does it smell like?",
