                  en: "Weather changes every day! 🌤️\n\nSunny ☀️: Wear light clothes. Cloudy ☁️: Bring a jacket. Rainy 🌧️: Use umbrella 🌂, wear rain boots 🥾. Windy 💨: Wear windbreaker. Snowy ❄️: Wear thick coat 🧥, hat 🧢.\n\nWeather recording: Draw a weather symbol every day. ☀️=Sunny ☁️=Cloudy 🌧️=Rainy ❄️=Snowy\n\nThis way we can see weather changes over a week!",
