                  en: "Today we learn subtraction! ➖\n\nSubtraction means taking some away and seeing how many are left.\n\nExample: You have 5 cookies 🍪🍪🍪🍪🍪, eat 2, how many left? 5 - 2 = 3 🍪🍪🍪\n\nUse fingers: Hold up 5 fingers, bend down 2, 3 are left!\n\nMore examples: 3-1=2, 4-2=2, 5-3=2\n\nRemember: '-' means take away or remove.\n\nSubtraction rhyme: Subtraction, subtraction, take away, count how many are left, bend your fingers to count fast!",
