                  en: "This lesson covers Propagation of Sound.\n\nPropagation of Sound is an important topic in science. Through this lesson, we will understand its basic principles, observe related phenomena, and conduct experimental investigations.\n\nBasic Principles: The core principles of Propagation of Sound are the foundation for understanding this field. We will introduce these principles in a simple and understandable way.\n\nPhenomenon Observation: In daily life, we can observe many phenomena related to Propagation of Sound. Through careful observation and recording, we can discover patterns.\n\nExperimental Investigation: Hands-on experiments are an important method for learning science. We will design simple experiments to verify the principles of Propagation of Sound.\n\nLife Applications: Propagation of Sound has wide applications in daily life. Understanding these applications helps us appreciate the importance of scientific knowledge.\n\nScientific Spirit: Learning Propagation of Sound is not just about acquiring knowledge, but more importantly about developing curiosity, critical thinking, and inquiry.",
