                  en: "This lesson covers Leadership and Responsibility.\n\nLeadership and Responsibility is an important theme in English learning. Through this lesson, we will learn related vocabulary, grammatical structures, and expressions.\n\nCore Vocabulary: We will learn key vocabulary related to Leadership and Responsibility, including nouns, verbs, and adjectives. These words are the foundation for understanding and expression.\n\nGrammar Points: The grammatical structures in this lesson will help us express our thoughts more accurately. We need to master sentence patterns, tense usage, and voice changes.\n\nReading Comprehension: By reading articles related to Leadership and Responsibility, we can improve our reading comprehension skills and learn to understand vocabulary and sentences in context.\n\nWriting Practice: We will practice writing short essays related to Leadership and Responsibility, learning how to organize paragraphs, use connectors, and express opinions.\n\nOral Expression: Through discussions and role-plays, we will practice expressing opinions about Leadership and Responsibility in English.",
